                      "topic": "Enrichment plugins (22-10-26)",
                      "id": "2870c014b517fe82",
                      "note": "Ofek: the index should accept plugins that update it, e.g. ask an LLM to complete or check aliases, without depending on them.",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "topic": "Where plugins hook in",
                          "id": "44badd39f4d142a0",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "topic": "⭐ A. Plugins are proposers: they emit changesets, never write the index",
                              "id": "4110e8759252e0a6",
                              "note": "Every proposal goes through validate -> policy -> review -> next build. Same path as Flow C."
                            },
                            {
