                {
                  "topic": "4. Resolve flow",
                  "id": "38cf5290cfdff3fb",
                  "note": "normalize → exact → decompose (vendor/category/residue) → candidates → decide. Feeds the flow diagram.",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "topic": "Flow",
                      "id": "803889ec3d66897a",
                      "note": "normalize → exact alias → decompose → candidates → decide",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "topic": "1. Normalize (mechanical only)",
                          "id": "2b0234f32a96ec67"
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "2. Exact alias lookup",
                          "id": "d9576f75e4c54ce7",
                          "note": "1 entity → done (1.0); ambiguous → continue with remaining evidence; miss → decompose."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "3. Decompose: vendor n-grams (vendor_aliases), category keywords, residue = product",
                          "id": "694242d697454eaa"
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "4. Candidates by what was found",
                          "id": "cd4437c27899707a",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "topic": "vendor + residue → that vendor's products (then descendants)",
                              "id": "3521c7a227d88fc8"
                            },
                            {
                              "topic": "vendor only → vendor entity / flagship platform",
                              "id": "f9ea710530c3150a"
                            },
                            {
                              "topic": "category only → entities in category, token index",
                              "id": "d3f011a5803f39db"
                            },
                            {
                              "topic": "nothing → rare-token inverted index, IDF-weighted",
                              "id": "7563980d55ad1152"
                            }
                          ],
                          "expanded": false
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "5. Decide",
                          "id": "fe4d524478ce0dba",
                          "note": "Min margin top-1 vs top-2; tie across vendors/categories → ambiguous + alternatives; residue unmatched → never fall back to parent; below threshold → no match + review queue; tie-break (score desc, entity_id asc)."
                        }
                      ],
                      "expanded": false
                    },
                    {
                      "topic": "Normalization rules",
                      "id": "0a28817d37f9f15c",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "topic": "⭐ Unicode NFKC, lowercase, trim",
                          "id": "a7855a77bd552ed3",
                          "note": "Also fixes U+202F seen in KEV."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "✗ Strip punctuation, collapse whitespace",
                          "id": "62bad66877ff1cf6",
                          "note": "C++/C#/C and .NET/NET collapse. Use a symbol table (+→plus, #→sharp) instead."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "✗ Drop noise words: Cloud, Platform, Inc",
                          "id": "216d40d777dcc452",
                          "note": "'Google Cloud' → 'Google' merges product into vendor (hard negative)."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "↻ Expand known acronyms: AWS, GCP",
                          "id": "a543c5ae4fe0d2e5",
                          "note": "Move to build time: expansions become alias rows (Q6)."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "⭐ Versions kept as separate field",
                          "id": "f9a6b35d5caee5e8",
                          "note": "'Log4j2', 'Struts 1' show versions glued to names."
                        }
                      ],
                      "expanded": false,
                      "note": "Copied from Design V1; verdicts added in V2."
                    },
                    {
                      "topic": "Candidate retrieval",
                      "id": "af12c8ce5de2eb1f",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "topic": "Step 1: exact alias hit",
                          "id": "8ac48c914dc71455"
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "Step 2: token-set match, same vendor",
                          "id": "3e3b88b73beed354"
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "Step 3: RAG / embedding top-k, offline suggestions only",
                          "id": "4ed3d23cef541bb9"
                        }
                      ],
