                    },
                    {
                      "topic": "Sanguino & Uetz 2017: inventory name → CPE",
                      "id": "dd90642276cea677",
                      "note": "Computers & Security. Closest to 'match against what the customer runs'.",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "topic": "Search product with and without vendor token",
                          "id": "26e1263ad342f201",
                          "note": "Some CPE products embed the vendor name. → alias generation (Q5 A)."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "Levenshtein ≤ 2, justified by deprecated CPE typo fixes",
                          "id": "ac98fe327e8ae484",
                          "note": "Higher thresholds produce false matches ('player' ~ 'joomla' at 6). → citable fuzzy guardrail."
                        },
                        {
                          "topic": "Auto top-1 wrong for 2 of 12 → ranked list + human pick",
